The bugs are all in `Get`: the incorrect ceiling calculation for `TotalPages` (the `+1` in `len/size + 1`), the off-by-one in the end clamping (`len(items) - 1`), the lack of a guard for out-of-range pages (panics on `items[start:end]`), and the returned slice aliasing the input, which violates its own doc comment. Currently fixing:
